_model: proposition
---
title: Proposition 14
---
order: 14
---
short_label: VI.14
---
sections:

#### prop_section ####
kind: proposition
----
statement: In equal and equiangular parallelograms the sides about the equal angles are reciprocally proportional; and equiangular parallelograms in which the sides about the equal angles are reciprocally proportional are equal.
----
proof:

Let {AB} and {BC} be equal and equiangular parallelograms having the angles at {B} equal, and let {DB} and {BE} be placed in a straight line. Therefore {FB} and {BG} are also in a straight line. [!just I.14]

I say that, in {AB} and {BC}, the sides about the equal angles are reciprocally proportional, that is to say, {DB} is to {BE} as {BG} is to {BF}.

